# The Upcoming view lists blocks started or due from tomorrow to a week from today, and leaves out today, the past, day eight, undated blocks and @today alone.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Today due @due({today})
	- Tomorrow due @due({today+1})
	- Week due @due({today+7})
	- Eight days @due({today+8})
	- Start soon @start({today+3})
	- Past due @due({today-1})
	- Undated
	- Today tag @today
	- Not a date @due(soon)
END
see Errands:
keys gU
see Upcoming
see Tomorrow ·
see - Tomorrow due  Errands
see - Week due  Errands
see - Start soon  Errands
hide Today due
hide Eight days
hide Past due
hide Undated
hide Today tag
hide Not a date
